@template chatty
// One of the ten voice templates (the head writer, with social B). Its words match section 20c's VOICE_FALLBACK, so
// baking it changes nothing; the template's own lines (content/templates/chatty.lines) come in wave 2.
talk: Talks fast and a lot, happy to gossip kindly, exclamation marks.
hi: Hey hey | Oh, hi
bye: Catch you later | Right, I'll let you go
yes: Yes! Totally | Oh, go on
thanks: You're a star | Thanks a million
wow: No way
sigh: Ugh
nick: - | - | - | pal | pal
needs: share
